{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15026","headline":"詶包佶郎中览拙卷後见寄 · 卢纶","name":"詶包佶郎中览拙卷後见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令伯支离晚读书，岂知词赋称相如。\n枉逢花木无新思，拙就溪潭损旧居。\n禁路看山歌自缓，云司玩月漏应疎。\n沈忧敢望金门召，空媿巴歈并子虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}